            "sid": "2KI 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kerai Akas loka ikar akaisaarei egeuni airum; kirumak ikar itomon ka lukanykape koYerusalem: mam abu kiswama nuejokuka kakonyen nuka EJAKAIT Ekedeke, kwape papaake Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konye kolosenenei orot loka ikabakan luka Isirael, eebo, kitotor okokuke akim, kwape ajaatar italesia luka ikapirin, luabu EJAKAIT kirene kakonyen nuka idwe luka Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
