              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ekabaka Akas kicorak Uriya esasedoti ebe, “Kieweenenei kotem loepol ainakinet naicweio naka tupuruc ka ainakinet naka akiria naka eboŋ, ka ainakinet naicweio naka eka baka, ka ainakineteke naka akiria, nepepe kainakinet naicweio naka ituŋa kere luka akwap, ka ainakinetekee naka akiria, ka ainakinetakee numatan; kobwatanakini ŋes aokot kere nuka ainakinet naicweio, ka aokot kere nuka asuban: konye eraun etem loka aisinit lokinitununetekaŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
