              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erot loarapakinitai loka asabato loadukitoi toma togo, ka erute loka ekabaka lokokina, kibelokinoi kiton togo loka EJAKAIT, kanuka ekabaka loka Asuria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
